id: massive-barrier
name: Massive Barrier
advancement: true
prerequisite: Insight Score 6+
tpCost: 15
# "If you use the Barrier Unique Ability when hit by an Attacking Maneuver that has an AoE and hit multiple
# Characters, you may increase the Ki Point Cost by 4(T) to apply the reduction to Damage to all Characters hit by
# that Attacking Maneuver." Offered on Barrier's window when it is so.
massiveBarrier: true
massiveKiPerTier: 4
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Against an AoE that hit several: for 4(T) KP more, everyone it hit takes the reduction.
text: >
  Massive Barrier: Your barrier can protect your comrades as well.
  –Prerequisites: Insight Score 6+
  –TP Cost: 15
  –Effect: If you use the Barrier Unique Ability when hit by an Attacking Maneuver that has an AoE and hit multiple
  Characters, you may increase the Ki Point Cost by 4(T) to apply the reduction to Damage to all Characters hit by
  that Attacking Maneuver.
